of them, remain subject to their respective owners' rights; Apache-2.0 does not
grant rights to those materials.

FirstLight Zero does not connect to Supercell official servers or operate
official accounts. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or representative of
Supercell. Product names identify compatibility only.

